Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:31.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都说了随便你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.23,0:01:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对小泉什么感觉都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实 我会魔法哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:49.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的魔法 会让小泉同学得到幸福哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.85,0:01:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有话在先啊 小泉喜欢的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她才不会喜欢你这样的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.03,0:02:03.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的 这次真的不再喜欢大谷了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次真的 要回到过去的关系了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱的铁拳！收下吧 少女之魂！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.37,0:03:01.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.15,0:03:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,状态绝佳！看到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.99,0:03:08.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不会输给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:13.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你尽管放马过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.03,0:03:18.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得好 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哟哟哟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:23.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在不给MAITY加油了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:26.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY老师确实很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.39,0:03:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是大谷凭着弱小的身体还那么努力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表扬一下也未尝不可啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.47,0:03:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你跟大谷现在到底是怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样…也没什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:46.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没发生 恢复到过去的关系了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.22,0:03:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.55,0:03:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相声二人组复活啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:55.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,复活？真的？你们怎么又回去了？？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.83,0:03:59.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么不好啊 结果还是那种关系感觉最好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.63,0:04:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 你明白自己现在的处境吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:04.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷他啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.23,0:04:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉部长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:09.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,部长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY要…要解散了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:16.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…啊…那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好过分 MAITY老师居然已经有未婚妻了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.41,0:04:22.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.29,0:04:26.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来也没打算瞒你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是从谁那里听说了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:36.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都很沮丧呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.55,0:04:40.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉同学好像一点也不沮丧嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.37,0:04:42.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…啊…那个…那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:44.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY你听听
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:48.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎说她和大谷又恢复到相声二人组的关系了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说说她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:57.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉同学居然是个胆小鬼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 总之 大谷能恢复状态真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.82,0:05:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:18.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔法还没有解开哦 小泉同学
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,集合 集合
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.83,0:05:26.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扭伤已经痊愈了 现在状态绝佳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.49,0:05:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,篮球部的3年级社员引退赛日益临近
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:31.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他更是卖力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.94,0:05:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.67,0:05:36.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有话在先啊 小泉喜欢的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:38.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她才不会喜欢你这样的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.66,0:05:45.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫非是…吃醋？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:47.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.39,0:05:49.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等..等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:52.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也不要抱有无望的期待
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:05:58.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到过去 回到过去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:06.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这以后你要怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:11.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你挡道了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.07,0:06:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:14.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很痛耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.38,0:06:17.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也用不着打我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.95,0:06:20.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是是是 对不起啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.73,0:06:27.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:32.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 真是对不起了 我的腿太长了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:33.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找死啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要揍你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎真的要回到过去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:07.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 篮球部的比赛是周六举行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我去看看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:10.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙还真闲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.73,0:07:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那有什么不好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我做那个带过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:15.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是篮球经理经常带的那个很可爱的东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:23.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酱油腌柠檬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种东西能吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道错了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.74,0:07:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醋腌柠檬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.83,0:07:30.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那要酸死的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要来了 你还是不要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:34.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:36.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得想去给你加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.71,0:07:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃了那种怪东西 原本能打好的都打不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.21,0:07:42.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啦好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.07,0:07:45.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大不了我做给MAITY老师吃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:48.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 明天顾问就复出了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:50.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙已经派不上用场了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.94,0:07:52.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活该
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:57.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是…吃醋？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛自己一个人在那摇头
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:03.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当你是狗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:09.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很痛耶…真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了 柠檬用蜂蜜腌就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈 这样啊 用蜂蜜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊是啊 要用蜂蜜哦 不要搞措了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到过去 回到过去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.57,0:08:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:41.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蜂蜜腌柠檬是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.89,0:08:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又甜又酸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.39,0:08:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 有时间说相声二人组复活的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.15,0:08:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不如赶紧凑在一块算了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.56,0:08:54.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:58.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来就看大谷会不会采取行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:08:59.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后的关键还是掌握在大谷手上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.09,0:09:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 你去说说他啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.26,0:09:08.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 这时候应该要让两个年轻人自己来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是交给她们俩 就算等到老太婆也还是老样子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.71,0:09:14.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他推倒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把大谷推倒 立马把他占为己有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:41.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然就由我上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:45.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看你们 真是皇帝不急 急死太监
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:46.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了算了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:47.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要在一起就赶紧在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:48.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也太乱来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:51.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了算了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪有你说得这么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:09:57.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没关系了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.97,0:10:00.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经不抱任何期望了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不抱期望？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:04.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你也不可能完全放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.88,0:10:06.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（猜中心事）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.90,0:10:13.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会是想 等大谷来告白之前什么都不做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:14.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.59,0:10:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.59,0:10:22.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:26.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要等那种人有所行动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:29.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟在游泳池钓鱼有什么两样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:31.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 可是 里面搞不好有鲤鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:33.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不会有那种游泳池
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:39.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 心情很好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就会知道比赛的分组了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是篮球部的比赛？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.80,0:10:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:46.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是最后一次大赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我超期待的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.80,0:10:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂 回去时顺便买点东西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.98,0:10:54.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一不小心拼到决赛该怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:05.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:08.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该拼的时候可是很会拼的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.99,0:11:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可别又重新爱上我哟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:13.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神经病
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.87,0:11:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你说啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.49,0:11:20.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:24.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说如此 我却没法放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:28.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.43,0:11:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能不能再期待一下呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,集合
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:46.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目标是参加决赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也太夸张了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:11:58.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的果然是候补啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.52,0:12:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你还是会去加油的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去是会去的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.60,0:12:05.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的？你会来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.90,0:12:06.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中尾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.01,0:12:08.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大赛的分组安排表
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很劲爆的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:19.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干脆大赛那天把千春他们也叫来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.05,0:12:21.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起来加油增加气势
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 说得也是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什…什…什…什…什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:33.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们第一回合的对手是去年的优胜队 超勇猛的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:40.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:42.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是要打进决赛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.48,0:12:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能了 不可能了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.58,0:12:47.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不妙 变成机器人了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.91,0:12:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完了 已经完了…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好！开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:11.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉同学居然是个胆小鬼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 正如MAITY说的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:19.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是害怕知道大谷的真实想法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.26,0:13:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了 柠檬用蜂蜜腌就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:28.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样下去 这样一直伪装回到过去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么也不做 一定会后悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:37.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷怎么想我都没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.94,0:13:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好慢喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:53.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.89,0:13:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比赛要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.35,0:13:59.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.45,0:14:02.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么啊 一大早就吓唬人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:05.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 累成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:09.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我熬夜做了一些加油小道具
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.48,0:14:10.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油小道具？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.67,0:14:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从今天起 你们都是大谷啦啦队的一分子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.81,0:14:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.99,0:14:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:23.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.55,0:14:34.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了算了 队长
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:36.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么丧气嘛 加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.51,0:14:38.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.47,0:14:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也会坐在候补位置上为大家加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.77,0:14:47.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 你就是队长 大谷？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:57.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一回合的对手是我们 请多多指教喽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:14:59.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I…my…me…my
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.49,0:15:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,you…you…are…you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:10.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家好 我们是大谷啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:11.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:13.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:15.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 你们来了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.92,0:15:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 大谷人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:20.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他刚刚跟对手碰过面 受到不小的刺激
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.56,0:15:21.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摇摇晃晃的不知道去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.09,0:15:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是马上就要比赛了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.61,0:15:29.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 我去看看他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 我被强迫加入大谷啦啦队了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 反正我是候补球员
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:39.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就帮大谷加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.82,0:15:42.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最爱中尾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:51.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.19,0:15:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:16:01.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,硬要说的话 算是集中精神吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.25,0:16:03.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.87,0:16:05.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:09.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 走啦 比赛要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:11.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么大谷啦啦队 真丢人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:15.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里丢人了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:17.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家特地来帮你加油
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了 没什么油好加的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.18,0:16:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正输定了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.37,0:16:28.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你弄得这么声势浩大 输的时候反而更丢人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这懦夫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没比就输输输的 本来会赢的都赢不了了 大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:43.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有什么办法 碰到那种队
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.20,0:16:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 这样 是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.51,0:16:48.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:51.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会给你这样的家伙加油
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:55.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后我一辈子都叫你矮人国丧家犬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.94,0:17:03.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.31,0:17:37.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这什么玩意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:40.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？回去？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.95,0:17:41.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.29,0:17:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.63,0:17:45.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我昨天整晚没睡 困得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫有男朋友的人做出这种背叛行为
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:51.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给你站住
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.69,0:17:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事没事 我们去加油就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.87,0:17:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.07,0:17:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法 我不想看他比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.36,0:17:58.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.78,0:18:02.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种…那种毫无斗志的矮人国丧家犬的比赛…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:03.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁是矮人国丧家犬？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.33,0:18:08.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么回去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先好好加油再回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.60,0:18:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.68,0:18:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:16.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了 我才不帮那种没斗志的人加油
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.77,0:18:18.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 我斗志正旺呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久没挨你的笨蛋拳了 还蛮有效的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.13,0:18:27.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你仔细看好 我保证你一定会迷上我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.89,0:18:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:32.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈哈 随便你说啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.09,0:18:35.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么阵容啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.29,0:18:45.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经不仅仅是高大可以形容的了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.01,0:18:47.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.19,0:18:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是当然
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:52.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷可是个该拼就会拼的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.15,0:19:09.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 大谷好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:10.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么高大的都被他甩掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.53,0:19:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.67,0:19:25.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好球
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.92,0:19:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.44,0:19:48.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这柠檬是用什么腌的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.77,0:19:49.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.71,0:19:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:52.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒酿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:53.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒酿？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为家里刚好没有蜂蜜了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.31,0:19:59.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好没在比赛前吃…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.87,0:20:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家整晚没睡 硬是撑着快合上的眼睛给你做的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.38,0:20:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:16.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枉费你特地来帮我加油 我却输了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.71,0:20:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你很帅呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.68,0:20:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害我又迷上你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:31.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是有你加油 也不会打出这么好的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.78,0:20:32.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.61,0:20:47.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然你说过要放弃喜欢我了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.27,0:20:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.63,0:21:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能没有小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.62,0:21:15.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.01,0:21:18.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我好好听啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.41,0:21:36.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎这个笨蛋 干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.52,0:21:37.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了算了算了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.11,0:23:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,预告
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.63,0:23:07.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉 你生日想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.01,0:23:10.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么可爱的戒指我都不想要
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.27,0:23:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要的只有大谷的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.21,0:23:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是非卖品
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.94,0:23:15.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恋爱情结 love com 次回
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.11,0:23:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,史上最棒的生日
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.73,0:23:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要看噢
